  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 日本語版「オオアレチノギク」",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%82%AA%E3%82%AA%E3%82%A2%E3%83%AC%E3%83%81%E3%83%8E%E3%82%AE%E3%82%AF",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 105445097,
      "text": "オオアレチノギク は、キク科イズハハコ属の植物の一種。種小名は「スマトラの」という意味であるが、南アメリカ原産で、日本では昭和初期からの帰化植物。道端や荒れ地で見られる雑草。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Erigeron sumatrensis」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erigeron_sumatrensis",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1370193471,
      "text": "Erigeron sumatrensis is an annual herb probably native to South America, but widely naturalised in tropical and subtropical regions, and regarded as an invasive weed in many places.It is a perennial in the Western Cape of South Africa."
    }
  },
